# `dfo::DfoBuilder`

A chainable description of a derivative-free problem and its options, solved with `solve()`.

## Signature

```cpp
dfo::DfoBuilder dfo::DFO::build();
dfo::DfoBuilder dfo::DFO::build(const pluss::Series &initial);
dfo::DfoResult dfo::DfoBuilder::solve() const;
```

## Construction

Start from [`DFO::build()`](DFO/build.md). The default-constructed builder is empty; `DfoBuilder(problem)` and `DfoBuilder(problem, options)` start from existing values.

## Methods

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| [`options`](DfoBuilder/options.md) | Returns the options collected so far. |
| [`problem`](DfoBuilder/problem.md) | Returns the problem collected so far. |
| [`solve`](DfoBuilder/solve.md) | Runs the collected problem with the collected options. |
| [`with_auto_policy`](DfoBuilder/with_auto_policy.md) | Sets the thresholds `Auto` uses. |
| [`with_blackbox`](DfoBuilder/with_blackbox.md) | Sets a black-box evaluation that returns objectives, constraints and a success flag. |
| [`with_bounds`](DfoBuilder/with_bounds.md) | Sets lower and upper bounds on every variable. |
| [`with_check_every`](DfoBuilder/with_check_every.md) | Sets how often the improvement test is applied. |
| [`with_constraints`](DfoBuilder/with_constraints.md) | Sets inequality constraints `g(x) ≤ 0`. |
| [`with_constraints_values`](DfoBuilder/with_constraints_values.md) | Sets inequality and equality constraints through `DfoConstraintValues`. |
| [`with_de_config`](DfoBuilder/with_de_config.md) | Sets the settings of the differential evolution method. |
| [`with_de_prmm_config`](DfoBuilder/with_de_prmm_config.md) | Sets the settings of the adaptive differential evolution method. |
| [`with_display_iter`](DfoBuilder/with_display_iter.md) | Turns the per-iteration display on or off. |
| [`with_initial`](DfoBuilder/with_initial.md) | Sets the starting point. |
| [`with_mads_config`](DfoBuilder/with_mads_config.md) | Sets the settings of the mesh-adaptive methods. |
| [`with_max_evaluations`](DfoBuilder/with_max_evaluations.md) | Sets the objective-evaluation budget. |
| [`with_max_iterations`](DfoBuilder/with_max_iterations.md) | Sets the iteration (generation) budget. |
| [`with_max_total_evaluations`](DfoBuilder/with_max_total_evaluations.md) | Sets a budget that also counts cache hits (MADS). |
| [`with_nelder_mead_config`](DfoBuilder/with_nelder_mead_config.md) | Sets the settings of the Nelder-Mead method. |
| [`with_objective`](DfoBuilder/with_objective.md) | Sets the objective, a function of the point that returns a real scalar. |
| [`with_options`](DfoBuilder/with_options.md) | Replaces all options. |
| [`with_problem`](DfoBuilder/with_problem.md) | Replaces the whole problem. |
| [`with_promote_cpu_to_float64`](DfoBuilder/with_promote_cpu_to_float64.md) | Chooses whether single-precision CPU inputs are computed in double precision. |
| [`with_pso_config`](DfoBuilder/with_pso_config.md) | Sets the settings of the particle swarm method. |
| [`with_pso_dv_config`](DfoBuilder/with_pso_dv_config.md) | Sets the settings of the differential-velocity swarm method. |
| [`with_seed`](DfoBuilder/with_seed.md) | Sets the seed of the random numbers. |
| [`with_solver`](DfoBuilder/with_solver.md) | Chooses the method. |
| [`with_tolerance`](DfoBuilder/with_tolerance.md) | Sets the relative-improvement stopping tolerance. |

## Changelog

- **0.1**: initial documented surface.

